      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some avatars have a really hard time with the Facemirror. Would be nice to be able to adjust it.\n\nUsing the camera is annoying and using a selfmade FaceCam is only hurting the performance.\n\nOn some its only half of the face in the FaceMirror on some like in my picture is nothing other to see then the nose.\n\nAnd its not only a problem with small avatars.\n\nSome big Avatars have the same problems.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
