  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-16T16:39:07.740Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Current face mirrors have a problem in that characters with large faces cannot fit their entire face in it.\nAs a solution to that, add an option to change the distance between the face and the camera.\nThis image represents the problem. In this avatar, only the center of the face is shown in the mirror.",
